g]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-ml-nondeg]] — 随机序列非可计算"}],"outgoing":["0586e0fd0301d605","f357216a7edb035a","e738767b1d98289f"]}